<!-- qPCR — 3 pasos controlados por botones -->
<div class="anim-wrapper step-1" data-total-steps="3" data-current-step="1">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 280 160" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="Animación qPCR">

    <!-- Fase 1 (siempre visible): ejes, grid, umbral, badge -->
    <g data-phase="1">
      {[40, 80, 120].map(y => (
        <line x1="40" y1={y} x2="260" y2={y} stroke="#1e3a5f" stroke-width="0.5" />
      ))}
      {[80, 120, 160, 200, 240].map(x => (
        <line x1={x} y1="20" x2={x} y2="140" stroke="#1e3a5f" stroke-width="0.5" />
      ))}
      <line x1="40" y1="72" x2="260" y2="72" stroke="#ffb300" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3" opacity="0.7" />
      <text x="262" y="75" fill="#ffb300" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" opacity="0.9">Ct</text>
      <line x1="40" y1="20" x2="40" y2="140" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <line x1="40" y1="140" x2="260" y2="140" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <text x="130" y="154" fill="#64748b" font-size="8" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle">Ciclos (1–40)</text>
      <text x="14" y="85" fill="#64748b" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90, 14, 85)">Fluorescencia</text>
      <rect x="196" y="6" width="58" height="14" rx="4" fill="rgba(0,229,255,0.1)" stroke="rgba(0,229,255,0.4)" stroke-width="0.8" />
      <text x="225" y="16" fill="#00e5ff" font-size="7.5" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">qPCR</text>
    </g>

    <!-- Fase 2: curva sigmoide (se dibuja al aparecer) -->
    <g data-phase="2" style="display: none">
      <path
        d="M 45,135 C 60,134 75,133 90,132 C 105,131 115,128 125,118 C 135,108 140,90 148,78 C 156,66 162,42 175,30 C 185,22 195,20 210,19 C 225,18 240,18 255,18"
        stroke="#00e5ff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"
        class="curve-path"
      />
    </g>

    <!-- Fase 3: marcador Ct -->
    <g data-phase="3" style="display: none">
      <line x1="148" y1="72" x2="148" y2="140" stroke="#ffb300" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 2" class="ct-fade" />
      <text x="144" y="150" fill="#ffb300" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" class="ct-fade">~Ct 30</text>
      <circle cx="148" cy="72" r="4" fill="#ffb300" class="ct-fade" />
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Leyenda -->
  <div class="legend">
    <span class="leg"><span class="lbar" style="background:#00e5ff"></span>curva = fluorescencia acumulada</span>
    <span class="leg"><span class="ldash" style="border-color:#ffb300"></span>umbral = nivel de detección Ct</span>
    <span class="leg"><span class="ldot" style="background:#ffb300"></span>punto = valor Ct diagnóstico</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Texto del paso activo -->
  <div class="step-text step-text-1">
    <span class="snum">1/3</span>
    <p>ADN molde añadido al tubo. El gráfico muestra fluorescencia vs. ciclos. La polimerasa copiará el fragmento diana en cada ciclo, unida a una sonda fluorescente que emite luz al amplificar.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step-text step-text-2">
    <span class="snum">2/3</span>
    <p>La señal fluorescente crece exponencialmente ciclo a ciclo. La curva sigmoide tiene tres fases: <strong>lag</strong> (baja señal), <strong>exponencial</strong> (amplificación activa) y <strong>plateau</strong> (reactivos agotados).</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step-text step-text-3">
    <span class="snum">3/3</span>
    <p>El <strong>Ct</strong> es el ciclo donde la curva cruza el umbral ámbar. Menos molde inicial → Ct más alto. Permite cuantificar copias de ctDNA con alta sensibilidad (hasta 1–5 moléculas).</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Controles -->
  <div class="step-controls">
    <button data-action="anim-prev" class="step-btn" disabled>← Anterior</button>
    <span class="step-indicator">1 / 3</span>
    <button data-action="anim-next" class="step-btn">Siguiente →</button>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .anim-wrapper { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
  svg { width: 100%; }

  .legend {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 10px;
    padding: 4px 7px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .leg { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
  .lbar { display: inline-block; width: 14px; height: 2px; border-radius: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .ldash { display: inline-block; width: 14px; height: 0; border-top: 2px dashed; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .ldot { display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }

  .step-text { display: none; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 7px; background: rgba(0,229,255,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,0.12); border-radius: 5px; min-height: 3.5rem; }
  .step-1 .step-text-1,
  .step-2 .step-text-2,
  .step-3 .step-text-3 { display: flex; }
  .snum { font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.58rem; color: var(--accent-cyan); flex-shrink: 0; font-weight: bold; padding-top: 1px; }
  .step-text p { font-size: 0.62rem; line-height: 1.42; color: var(--text-primary); margin: 0; }
  .step-text strong { color: var(--accent-amber); font-weight: 600; }

  .step-controls { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding-top: 5px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .step-btn { font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.65rem; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 5px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-card); color: var(--text-muted); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s; }
  .step-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { color: var(--accent-cyan); border-color: rgba(0,229,255,0.3); background: rgba(0,229,255,0.06); }
  .step-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.3; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .step-indicator { font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--accent-cyan); font-weight: bold; }

  /* Animaciones SVG — se activan al aparecer (display: none → block) */
  .curve-path {
    stroke-dasharray: 400; stroke-dashoffset: 400;
    animation: draw-curve 2s ease-out forwards;
  }
  .ct-fade { opacity: 0; animation: fade-in 0.6s ease-out 0.2s forwards; }
  @keyframes draw-curve { to { stroke-dashoffset: 0; } }
  @keyframes fade-in    { to { opacity: 1; } }
</style>
